      "text": "Today marks the one year anniversary of the worst liquidation event in crypto history.\n\nWhere on paper +$19,000,000,000 of leveraged positions were wiped in a matter of hours.\n\nAltcoins experienced wicks down into to their prior bear market lows, causing trades with only 2x leverage on top 10 altcoins to be liquidated.\n\nSome estimates stretch the total losses from nineteen billion to FIFTY billion dollars.\n\nI know friends who lost 7 figures that day.\n\nWill never forget 10/10, it reminded everyone in crypto to risk manage properly.",
